/target/
/gen/schemas/
# `tauri icon icons/icon.png --output icons` regenerates the platform icon set.
# Two files are not bundle-time artifacts: the source PNG, and `icon.ico`, which
# `tauri-build` embeds into the Windows resource file *while the crate compiles*
# — a checkout without it cannot `cargo build` on Windows at all. The rest
# (.icns, the Store logos, the Android/iOS trees) is regenerated by the release
# workflow right before bundling.
/icons/*
!/icons/icon.png
!/icons/icon.ico
